    "explanation": "Both accounts agree on the essentials, and the platform's own telemetry decides the rest.\n\nTo the driver: you marked arrived at 07:38:05 and cancelled at 07:48:10, and the log shows you told the rider you were at the bay. But the waiting clock for a no-show fee does not run from an 'arrived' tap. POL-NS-01(c) starts it at the first qualifying in-geofence GPS fix, and your own trace (EV-GPS-00209, weight 1.0) places you inside the 150 m Tampines interchange radius only from 07:44:14 until the 07:48:10 cancellation — 236 seconds, 64 seconds short of the 300 seconds a TRANSPORT_HUB pickup requires. The trip record's 10.1 minute wait is real but is measured from the arrival tap, which the policy does not accept, so it cannot carry the fee. Your point that the geofence test is met is accepted — the trace holds 25 qualifying in-radius fixes, so POL-NS-02's arrival test is satisfied — but the fee still fails on the dwell limb. The shortfall cannot be made up: the trace shows a single in-geofence run, so POL-NS-06(i) has no second interval to add to the first, and that limb in any event requires a present and populated traffic advisory; EV-ADVIS-00209-01 is MISSING (weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT), so limb (i) is unavailable. The fee is therefore not chargeable under POL-NS-06, and no driver compensation follows on a shortfall — POL-NS-07 also makes compensation conditional on POL-NS-01 being satisfied in full, which it is not. The $6.00 sum itself is correct (the greater of the TRANSPORT_HUB zone-class fee and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee) and there is no fare-integrity defect; it is simply not chargeable on these facts.\n\nBecause the $6.00 has already been reversed to the rider (EV-FARE-00209: payment_status REFUNDED, refund_issued_sgd 6.00), nothing further moves. Your claim that the charge should be restored is not supported by the evidence, and the present payment state stands — no further refund and no compensation are ordered. That disposition is NO_ACTION.\n\nTo the rider: your own track corroborates you — 88 fixes, stationary, 50.5 m to 91.7 m from the pin from 07:43:10, inside the 200 m hub radius — but the refund does not depend on your presence. POL-NS-04 is not available to you: you sent no locating or coordinating message during the waiting window, and the driver's two messages and the system arrival notice all sit unread, so limbs (a) and (b) are not met. The chat log is impaired at weight 0.85 with issue UNREAD_MESSAGE; that impairment concerns read receipts only, does not touch the dwell that decides this case, and does not place this ruling below the confidence floor.\n\nI also checked the escalation grounds: the POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip (3 no-show terminations in 30 days across 88 trips is below both the absolute and the rate limb), there are no repeat disputes between the same parties, no admissible artifacts contradict each other on the dwelling question without a clause to resolve it, and the deciding fact is carried by an unbroken 1.0-weight GPS trace, so the case is decided rather than held. No clause produces a referral, so the referrals list is empty."
